{lo'e du'u le xirma cu bajra cu mutce lo'e ka ce'u jetnu} 
exactly corresponds to the meaning of "very" that I am after.
I don't insist on {jetnu} there -- replace it with a selbri
meaning "(how much) the world would have to change for ce'u
to become false", if that makes anyone happier.

So I'm looking for a shorthand equivalent of 
{lo'e du'u ______ kei mutce lo'e du'u ce'u jetnu}
and it must be distinct from ways of saying "X is sort-of the case,
but close to being wholly the case".

